# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CodeHub - root reference file
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file is only a map of where real configuration lives.
# Copy the workspace-level examples instead:
#
#   cp server/.env.example server/.env
#   cp client/.env.example client/.env
#
# Never commit a real .env file. Secrets stay on your machine / host only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# server/.env  -> Mongo URI, JWT secrets, SMTP credentials, CLIST key
# client/.env  -> VITE_API_URL (public, non-secret)
